19. Conclusion
AI Presentation Builder combines a React frontend, Spring Boot backend, MySQL database and LLM-based generation into one automated presentation workflow. The frontend provides the user experience, the backend controls the application logic, the document-processing layer extracts source content, and the Groq LLaMA model generates the presentation structure.
The use of structured JSON is central to the design because it creates a clear connection between probabilistic AI output and deterministic application components. The current prototype provides a solid foundation for future features such as PowerPoint export, source traceability, audience-aware generation and automated quality checking.
